{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "784ecb3b1de93ef9310abcb6744a864bed40dd24727fce22e17dfe33be69a42e", "ja": "妖精たちのTV出演", "zh": "妖精们的电视演出", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "83b81d169f332a37b1232f4dfd87e399a2464d9a70a3951bad573cb01c763c39", "ja": "千早が出演する歌番組でFairyの公演を\n宣伝する静香とジュリア。突然千早から\nコメントを振られて慌てるものの、\nどうにか対応。あらためて千早からの期待を\n感じ、決意を新たにする。", "zh": "静香和茱莉亚将在千早演出的歌唱节目中宣传\nFairy的公演，虽然因为千早突然丢出话题\n而慌了手脚，但两人还是想办法应对，并再次\n感受到千早的期待，因此更坚定了决心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "894976f3ae743d1c2cce4cdcae563dab111892180abc2d4ea6ebb95c2a8b0202", "ja": "（千早が出演する歌番組に、静香とジュリアが\nコーラスとして参加することになった）", "zh": "（静香、茱莉亚将参加千早\n所演出的歌唱节目，负责和声。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "df9a25a8c450eeaf72aca6ff39672236a0979ff0818f873d630d834f2869d79c", "ja": "（Fairy公演も間近だからこそ、こういう機会に\nしっかり実力をアピールしてもらわないと）", "zh": "（正因为Fairy公演近在眼前，更要把握这种机会，\n好好宣传自己的实力才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_1002_eventshikai", "source_sha256": "9c48bd9f303f68ac771650f91804c73ecf24f1306868bda12ea70b16ced8481f", "ja": "こんばんは。歌は人生のBGM……。\n『ノーソング・ノーライフ』の時間です！", "zh": "各位晚安，歌曲是人生的BGM……\n又到了『NO SONG NO LIFE』的时间！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_1003_eventshikai", "source_sha256": "0edf2f4e72ec4ffe72d76e6afd5e622b9b7521e68c1477c5e71bf26b10ec1f91", "ja": "本日のゲストは、新世代の歌姫として評判の、\n如月千早さん。よろしくお願いしますねっ！", "zh": "今天的来宾是人称『新世代歌姬』的\n如月千早小姐，请多指教喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "f45d7ffa6c147b3598ad14b10a7e34ad20a6bdfb0139c448e065cc8112c13fd1", "ja": "よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "请多指教了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "2c0a14c4dee7358fb8f50f67a06bbe0bf06edbc8edf55ef416055500e6928c1f", "ja": "…………っ。", "zh": "…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "2c0a14c4dee7358fb8f50f67a06bbe0bf06edbc8edf55ef416055500e6928c1f", "ja": "…………っ。", "zh": "…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_1007_p", "source_sha256": "78cb6ef27f4313fded8bbd1f7004ad42cc82d19f1c7a990399d4982156a164dd", "ja": "（この番組は、ゴールデン枠で一番の人気番組だ。\n初出演のふたりは、緊張を隠せないみたいだな……）", "zh": "（这个节目是黄金时段最受欢迎的节目，\n初次演出的两人，似乎藏不住紧张……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_1008", "source_sha256": "897c2770b2a07e56c2a48704db7b6c73646f430a3b8664c1e5dfec5bde80e00d", "ja": "（リラックス！）", "zh": "（放轻松！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_2000_p", "source_sha256": "4eced8104965ac9fb1df74dfac0685446a0842d80a9c2677a6bc988b6238f64a", "ja": "（リラックス！　ほら、ちゃんとカメラを見て。\n千早もいるんだ、大丈夫！）", "zh": "（放轻松！好了，好好看着摄影机。\n千早也在，没事的！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_2003_p", "source_sha256": "fd9dd69de82e5656ec68e060fa4af427a7a61399b46ed3678fe29e6130fb5aef", "ja": "（よし、なんとか伝わった……）", "zh": "（好，她们总算明白了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_2004_eventshikai", "source_sha256": "d2040a6aef01954d1a36fbee963effdd969697b639e816d39e266f41aae09b2a", "ja": "前回ご登場いただいた時には、千早さんお一人でしたが\n……今回は、可愛らしいお仲間とご一緒なんですね？", "zh": "上次登场的时候，千早小姐是一个人来……\n今天是和可爱的伙伴们一起来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_2005_002chi", "source_sha256": "de502fd3e24d2f4457f417b694777956627b9238891e5e97d47d74e5e1f20a69", "ja": "はい。最上静香さんと、ジュリアです。二人の力で\n今日は、より奥行きのある世界観を表現できるかと。", "zh": "是的，这两位是最上静香和茱莉亚。今天借助\n她们的力量，应该能表现出更有深度的世界观。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_2006_eventshikai", "source_sha256": "37fbf74334612918a425f8e01da45ca3df18c5b841c9a50a034d8e220a89388b", "ja": "なるほど～。歌の世界をさらに広げるのが、\nお二人の役割だと！　……意気込みはいかがですか？", "zh": "原来如此～两位的任务是让歌曲的世界更加延伸！\n……说说你们的抱负吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_2007_015siz", "source_sha256": "ba68053b54634ffc520eb80e79e7c3dafa3dfb044ce807a294591287424588f7", "ja": "は、はい！　精一杯、がんばります！", "zh": "是、是的！我会尽全力加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_2008_050jul", "source_sha256": "8f74fa06cb95e3d76dd6d1dd9982a2c2ecd40204c13778b809d487580e5dfac5", "ja": "あ、ああ！　任せっ……てください！", "zh": "是、是啊！交……请交给我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_2009_eventshikai", "source_sha256": "81b93d8a2a99e231853d6d75c8895254c18eee77fc9ead3ca75fa13b101171c0", "ja": "これは期待できそうです。\nでは、さっそく歌っていただきましょう。どうぞ！", "zh": "真是值得期待，\n那么，就赶紧请她们演唱吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_2011_se", "source_sha256": "028462f1dfdd9d24259ded91cbe4a60e605838a01af2295e7ad5a8594ce60544", "ja": "パチパチパチパチ……！", "zh": "（掌声如雷）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_2012_eventshikai", "source_sha256": "b283981cab0dcffd52f8b5f40e004cebd099c4b5813aa840473c052d9fd5d666", "ja": "いやあ、すばらしい歌声、圧巻の歌唱力でした！", "zh": "哎呀，真是动听的歌声、精湛的歌艺！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_2013_002chi", "source_sha256": "f448bf50dfd4a5e9038bd0af73de349d5321f6e79d02a48ed9ced517b2afc058", "ja": "はい……。ありがとうございます。", "zh": "嗯……谢谢大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_2014_p", "source_sha256": "69b9b360973e801b1cd5dce3f5735232958662a8d8a89cb55013a1cc6c1aa89d", "ja": "（うん、歌の方は3人とも完ぺきだったな！\nあとはトークで、劇場を軽く紹介してもらって……）", "zh": "（嗯，唱歌的部分三个人都很完美！\n接下来就是在谈话间稍微介绍剧场……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_2015_eventshikai", "source_sha256": "4f58eb5019f858ff4967d34bb80015640864eab86be59326f218a81ead7c9812", "ja": "ところで、千早さんといえば、今話題の\nアイドル専用劇場に出演されているとか？", "zh": "话说回来，千早小姐似乎会于现在掀起话题的\n偶像专用剧场演出？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_2016_002chi", "source_sha256": "6ea3efbefe11983c8d94855cbde6f3138fb2b6548586048e1a23786fc745bae7", "ja": "はい。765プロライブ劇場のステージでも\n歌わせていただいています。", "zh": "是的，我也会在765艺能演唱会剧场\n的舞台献唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_2017_eventshikai", "source_sha256": "197fee929db262acde5907a904df98bbb56726be37c227575bb6806a17bdbc12", "ja": "そこにいけば、いつでも生で、\n今のような歌を聞けるわけですね？", "zh": "只要前往剧场，随时都能现场听到\n像刚刚那样的歌声对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_2018_002chi", "source_sha256": "724cd38f8336be0ed8aac35ae147f7c3f94568790c7f33589fae4fd487f4d5f7", "ja": "そうですね……。\nもしかしたら、今以上の歌も。", "zh": "这个嘛……\n说不定会比刚才更加动听。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_2019_eventshikai", "source_sha256": "93d4e695c727ae1a372358fc362576fc211c0d9c18ab40ffa42ecdf470540ce2", "ja": "えっ？　それは、どういうことです？", "zh": "咦？这是什么意思呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_2020_002chi", "source_sha256": "e45cbb863091c8bb247ca42ea1bdb9d945c0f394f934753916bd41e5cfecd82a", "ja": "先日、私を含め、最上さんとジュリアも所属する\nFairyというチームが、結成されたんですが……。", "zh": "日前，名为Fairy的分队正式成军了。\n除了我，最上和茱莉亚也是成员之一……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_2021_002chi", "source_sha256": "216aa7de1b0ec591771114f7a69c80d1165206e4156201cd7a94569d1bf81eab", "ja": "そのお披露目公演が、765プロライブ劇場で\n行われることになりました。", "zh": "而分队的首次亮相公演将会在\n765艺能演唱会剧场举行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_2022_002chi", "source_sha256": "ff08973836d806fe2083221fd3ebb576995b30d8e1284835d547777a2da98da7", "ja": "特に、オープニングナンバーに期待してください。\n最上さんとジュリアが、ボーカルメンバーなんです。", "zh": "尤其要特别期待开场的组合，\n最上和茱莉亚都将为各位献唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_2023_p", "source_sha256": "157e276d978d4a2a4ab346480dbdc4f30c47b28dd73c1a081ec509f1e9f8a693", "ja": "（千早？　そこまで告知する予定じゃ\nなかったはずだけど……）", "zh": "（千早？原本没有打算公开\n这么多资讯的……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_2024_eventshikai", "source_sha256": "9fd061cf7d86e2f9da9b06f836b56c8df3d7058506b3d563d23c05a3aff703ee", "ja": "それは興味深いですね！　先ほどの歌でも、\nお二人のコーラスは、とても印象的でしたから。", "zh": "这真是有意思呢！因为在刚刚的歌曲中，\n两位的和声也令人印象深刻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_2025_002chi", "source_sha256": "4a2975a07c6719f228c948ace2da59ddc587e1c63827010fc31b3c791e98349e", "ja": "はい。ふたりがきっと、お披露目公演の開幕に\nふさわしいステージを届けてくれるかと……。", "zh": "是的，她们一定能够表现出\n首次亮相公演应有的水准……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_2026_002chi", "source_sha256": "6cd02971843dbb6ecd08eebeb065d07f33ad3060d6c762ab95ce04016bc03daf", "ja": "ね、最上さん、ジュリア。", "zh": "对不对？最上、茱莉亚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_2027_015siz", "source_sha256": "4c02d1794eb30af319239c87c4d0ca385adb2a278ac9cb0b6bf5565ebb9cedf4", "ja": "え……っ！", "zh": "咦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_2028_050jul", "source_sha256": "4c02d1794eb30af319239c87c4d0ca385adb2a278ac9cb0b6bf5565ebb9cedf4", "ja": "え……っ！", "zh": "咦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_2029_002chi", "source_sha256": "18af2c1fa8c05ef53095cf151b2c5102a62f9149bc486036a0deb923b4d24af3", "ja": "あなたたちの……いいえ、私たちの歌を、みなさんに。\n届けてくれるかしら？", "zh": "你们会将你们的……不，是我们的歌\n带给大家对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_2032", "source_sha256": "e4043894d8285e2f87bae1b41ff464160551565a56f89bb5cdad5a26e13a9d49", "ja": "ゴーサインを送る", "zh": "表示许可", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_3000_p", "source_sha256": "240ca9a3853a00cafec842023a4f1a6507f23d3c1493a0ad331a49c04be68d57", "ja": "（千早がアドリブとは珍しい。でも、いい流れだ。\n二人とも、思いっきりアピールしていいぞ！）", "zh": "（千早难得脱稿演出，但话题的走向很好。\n你们可以尽情表现！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_3001_015siz", "source_sha256": "036915b88a774be181aba1a50ecf3a36ea1f5eef8b1bf9ad64331cfd3af3306b", "ja": "は、はいっ。全力でお届けしますから、あの……\n興味のある方は、ぜひお越しください！", "zh": "是、是的，我们会尽全力把表演带给大家的……\n有兴趣的观众请务必前来观赏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_3002_015siz", "source_sha256": "6cf604ea407cfc43c8787c6a97cc8b13e538879b3a7e9dfb81f85738b89bf572", "ja": "絶対に、感動してもらえると……思いますっ！", "zh": "我想，一定能够……感动大家的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_3003_050jul", "source_sha256": "f8a0b2413da312dd83b755e215e5989ac52a749b1065543906dac32f3af4efdd", "ja": "そ、そうそう！　歌はもちろんだけど、ダンスも\nステージパフォーマンスも全部決めてみせるからさ！", "zh": "对、对啊！歌唱就不用说了，\n舞蹈和舞台表演也全都会很精彩的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_3004_050jul", "source_sha256": "eee2687377e6a9f444ec5174e99519d45a50f5e70959edb2a4b6a116ffeb2bde", "ja": "みんなっ！\nウチらの劇場で、一緒に盛り上がろうぜ！", "zh": "各位！\n到我们的剧场来，一起嗨吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_3005_eventshikai", "source_sha256": "8c3ac2b79f6dfc3b9a8c1ad75a837035b0efa0e80f6001a1b951351a8cf28ff7", "ja": "素晴らしい！　私もTVの前の皆さんに、ぜひ、\n彼女達の歌を生で聞いてほしいと思ってます！", "zh": "真是太棒了！我也很希望电视机前的观众\n务必要听听她们的现场演唱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_3006_eventshikai", "source_sha256": "3adbcb4dd77571431b2ceb8ede5af10650b74c24ca3b043b83915369cb0b93fd", "ja": "では、いったんCMでーす。", "zh": "那么，我们先进一段广告。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_3007_p", "source_sha256": "de99a9f5ee83e59c61d09a46615ae107835680434a716b0cafead0409a06c932", "ja": "（こうして収録は、無事終了し……）", "zh": "（于是录影安然结束……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_3008_050jul", "source_sha256": "43681701cc2bbaafd0cc8ea2369e53f35d70630525073ede1f4afd610010a400", "ja": "くぅ、あたしとしたことが、焦っちまった……。\nチハ、話を振るなら振るって言っといてくれよな！", "zh": "呜，我也真是的，刚刚整个超紧张……\n千，你要把话题抛给我们可要先讲好啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_3009_002chi", "source_sha256": "ceeefe22f828a11c01393e6fe2e07334b191d9e2f1d45b0d5d81241fa42b2dcf", "ja": "ごめんなさい、ジュリア、最上さん……それに、\n{$P$}も。私ったら、つい……。", "zh": "对不起，茱莉亚、最上……还有\n{$P$}也是。我一不小心就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_3010_015siz", "source_sha256": "af8e619b917a7ce1fd6ca18433c03ba6d225f3b804543ce6e0455288c50695a8", "ja": "と、とんでもないです！　おかげで、\n今度の公演のアピールをすることができました。", "zh": "请、请别这么说！多亏了你，\n才能宣传这次公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_3011_015siz", "source_sha256": "f8e99e1d70f20bd72fb2e070004b6bee237d8f70d39ba409a93193597a5b3c3c", "ja": "でも、感動できるとか……、言い過ぎだったかも。\nあの、{$P$}、どう……でしたか？", "zh": "但感动之类的……可能说得太夸张了？那个，\n{$P$}，你觉得怎么样……呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_3012", "source_sha256": "8517d2137fa4a2738e703272e0d3da3a4b3577e111f1c60b694934900d076153", "ja": "あれでいい", "zh": "做得很好", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_4000_p", "source_sha256": "55008b468dd79035889b2a0851ae6a7f02312c8459c183b9b4d3bbe0cb5b3973", "ja": "あれでいいよ。実際、今日の静香とジュリアの\nコーラスは、すごくいい出来だったし。", "zh": "做得很好。就事实而言，今天静香和茱莉亚的\n和声也唱得非常棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_4001_p", "source_sha256": "f9cd7762c192e63e598994556bc81aeef4383333011a7256a7506b4eba1bb49b", "ja": "TVを見ていた人達も、\nきっと興味を持ってくれたと思うぞ！", "zh": "我想，电视前的观众\n一定也会产生兴趣的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_4002_002chi", "source_sha256": "3509d8586be35a7df05fb769c290b7263634f8d5eafa36f375f4bb4353ef1a9c", "ja": "そうなんです。二人の実力は伝わったはず。\nだから、どうしても紹介したくなって。", "zh": "没错，观众应该能感受到她们的实力。\n所以我才无论如何都想介绍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_4003_002chi", "source_sha256": "eb50b6e1f8dca507f564341573fe792c057f1371915d45bc84097c7e0b1228dc", "ja": "歌に込められた想いが、翼を広げて羽ばたいて\nいくような、二人の歌声を……。", "zh": "你们的歌声就像是让\n埋藏在歌曲中的心意展翅高飞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_4004_002chi", "source_sha256": "fa62901251517cb575d03e3abb851ef64f42ad78f3ab5d0591d1fc9a3040b2e1", "ja": "できるだけたくさんの人に、届けて欲しい。\nいいえ、一緒に届けましょう！", "zh": "我希望能尽可能地将你们的歌声传递给更多人。\n不，我们一起传递吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_4005_015siz", "source_sha256": "93a11ba5eab3a5f27ce8a77baac3ded6a9cc48f75ded21c8e51b3c84a036d565", "ja": "千早さん（チハ）……。", "zh": "千早（千）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_4006_050jul", "source_sha256": "44eef06f40ec2ab37b8c2fb5191fb41f54a296c03426f543291aae6db4981460", "ja": "チハ……。", "zh": "千……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_4007_015siz", "source_sha256": "5bdf5216d2a38ed350c7763937be5ec8f6007899077ba56c3877c36e4f52b533", "ja": "えっと……ジュリアさん。\n今から劇場に戻って、特訓しませんか？", "zh": "那个……茱莉亚，\n我们要不要现在回剧场特训呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_4008_050jul", "source_sha256": "f936748d128a1cc1eac8d76eccfdfa0ee8e312bb969b0072dc427b48605ae9b4", "ja": "フフッ、気が合うな、シズ。\nあたしも今、そう言おうと思ったんだ♪", "zh": "呵呵，我们真合拍呢，静。\n我也正想说♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_4009_002chi", "source_sha256": "fac77a1e1cb2ea65b118e7351373f41d0e6b9a9027c388b9cd954176a3d64c4e", "ja": "なら……、最上さん、ジュリア。\n私も参加させてもらっていいかしら？", "zh": "那么……最上、茱莉亚，\n能让我一起参加吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_4010_015siz", "source_sha256": "c1f0eaa635bb291a10b3bb3357191860beb0e8e9f10f6e8143755a3222a9f39c", "ja": "も、もちろんです！\nあ、でも……、ひとつだけ、お願いが……。", "zh": "这、这是当然的！\n啊，但是……有一件事想拜托你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_4011_002chi", "source_sha256": "33a0912ca634ce9b985033c8110c388e52a56aaac5603580fa5742e466e9fc10", "ja": "？　何かしら、最上さん。\n何でも言って。", "zh": "嗯？是什么呢，最上？\n尽管说吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_4012_015siz", "source_sha256": "32f3ac2a04b02e22829c29df95de0a1b2b1de0ac313b8f3ead07ebbdca33b1ab", "ja": "あの、せっかくこう……\n同じチームになれたことですし、その……。", "zh": "那个，难得像这样……\n进入同一个分队了，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_4013_015siz", "source_sha256": "7a518bf127f3a5b889fb2af2f2ddf085656d9fc400d9cfa03d2f9724c33f3b9b", "ja": "私のことも、名前で呼んでくれませんか！？\nジュリアさんだけ呼び捨てって、なんだか……不……。", "zh": "请问可以也用名字称呼我吗！？\n只对茱莉亚直呼名字，总觉得……不……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_4014_002chi", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_4015_050jul", "source_sha256": "bdd9ec8312a952325b0e09e9aa13eeb99ea18f4cdaca2b6ff53085d691bb53db", "ja": "それもそうだな。\nチハ、別にいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "这么说也是呢，\n千，没什么关系吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_4016_002chi", "source_sha256": "d594a5ddab2636e7cdae00736966b1e7e847c954f257443f9d1d8f1c41facb8c", "ja": "ふふっ、そうね。\nわかったわ、最上さ……。", "zh": "呵呵，说得没错呢，\n我知道了，最上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_4017_002chi", "source_sha256": "6157df5acb53a637db7d3f480895fecd068e6d9d77afebe77096558cf1594ee6", "ja": "ん、ん。\nわかったわ、静香。", "zh": "啊、嗯，\n我知道了，静香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_4018_015siz", "source_sha256": "d4556da9c72be55a6e628e68bc7e2390382ea34e263e43cd94d3594f6ec2ebcb", "ja": "……はいっ！", "zh": "……好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_4019_p", "source_sha256": "64773cd593d38f701d3f4a7eb9303852473792151c15acc4f6506ad77bc801ef", "ja": "さて。そうこうしている間に、レッスンルームも\n手配できたけど……。余計なお世話だったか？", "zh": "好了，在这段空档中，我也把练习室\n安排好了……是我多管闲事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_4020_050jul", "source_sha256": "218b90d29addd18e8d684140320c9a9f58c5fddef976185e33176a6c7477855c", "ja": "おおっと、とんでもない。\nフッ、珍しく仕事が早いね、{$P$}！", "zh": "哦喔，别这么说。\n呵，难得这么有效率呢，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_4021_050jul", "source_sha256": "018c0fb76fe783229cf0410fc02b8fd02d96e03ac6a9747c098b5c5a0fe0c142", "ja": "それじゃ、急いで戻るとするか。\n思いっきり歌うために、さ！", "zh": "那我们赶快回去吧，\n为了尽情练唱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_05_4022_p", "source_sha256": "273a29ad0cef1d3c2dc28618bc366196dbe3d5698a45dbc1f145ff1821831eb3", "ja": "（歌を通して高まった絆は、ステージの上で眩しいほど\n輝くだろう。……本番まで、あと少しだ！）", "zh": "（透过歌唱更加紧密的羁绊，应该会在舞台上\n绽放炫目的光辉吧……正式演出近在眼前！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
